  "content": "# 第30题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhat does the author intend to tell us?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Far-sighted thinking matters to humans.\n\nB. B. Humans tend to make long-term sacrifices.\n\nC. C. Current policies facilitate future decision-making.\n\nD. D. Bias towards the present helps reduce near-term desires.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nA\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查形容词比较级。根据‘than’可知用比较级，且‘much’修饰比较级，故选C。"
